jscpd — Copy/Paste Detector
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream repository: https://github.com/kucherenko/jscpd
Used for:            code duplication and similarity analysis in CodeArena
Integration method:  the published `jscpd` command-line interface, invoked as a
                     subprocess from the CodeArena analysis service, plus parsing
                     of its JSON reporter output. No jscpd source code is copied
                     into the CodeArena repository.
